::Q002::[markdown]fem. nom. sing. of the definite article “the”:{
	~%-100%τά#Incorrect. **τά** is the neut. acc. pl. of the definite article “the” (Ch. 1).
	~%-100%τῷ#Incorrect. **τῷ** is the neut. dat. sing. of the definite article “the” (Ch. 1).
	~%-100%τῶν#Incorrect. **τῶν** is the fem. gen. pl. of the definite article “the” (Ch. 1).
	~%-100%τούς#Incorrect. **τούς** is the masc. acc. pl. of the definite article “the” (Ch. 1).
	~%-100%τοῦ#Incorrect. **τοῦ** is the masc. gen. sing. of the definite article “the” (Ch. 1).
	~%100%ἡ#Correct: **ἡ** is the correct form for fem. nom. sing. of the definite article “the” (Chapter 1).
	~%-100%ταῖς#Incorrect. **ταῖς** is the fem. dat. pl. of the definite article “the” (Ch. 1).
	~%-100%τήν#Incorrect. **τήν** is the fem. acc. sing. of the definite article “the” (Ch. 1).
}


